Vendored source
---------------
The package vllm_nemotron_asr_streaming/nemotron_asr/ is derived from the
streaming Nemotron ASR model in the vLLM fork at
https://github.com/pdtgct/vllm, branch rfc1-5212-vllm, commit 43c0bed5bf,
directory vllm/models/nemotron_asr/. That code is Apache-2.0 and its files
keep their SPDX headers and contributor attribution ("Copyright contributors
to the vLLM project").

Changes made in this repository
-------------------------------
Every vendored module's imports were rewritten from vllm.models.nemotron_asr
to vllm_nemotron_asr_streaming.nemotron_asr.

The following vendored files carry further changes (see the git history):
  nemotron_asr/advance.py                     complete-file rows; staging; group order
  nemotron_asr/configuration_nemotron_asr.py  card translation moved to card_parser.py;
                                              control-token fields; no parse-time lookahead
  nemotron_asr/manifests.py                   single per-unit emission bound
  nemotron_asr/model_state_v2.py              host buffers for complete files; step planning;
                                              supported tasks; engine-setting re-check
  nemotron_asr/nemotron_asr.py                speech-to-text interface; served-set checks;
                                              logit width from the served configuration;
                                              realtime hook
  nemotron_asr/plan.py                        complete-file row role; served-geometry binding
  nemotron_asr/processor.py                   keep-on-CPU fields for complete files

New files written for this repository:
  nemotron_asr/file_rows.py
  and every module outside nemotron_asr/.

The model weights and checkpoint card (nvidia/nemotron-3.5-asr-streaming-0.6b)
are not part of this repository and are distributed by NVIDIA under their own
license.
